{
  "id": "pneumatic_cylinder___excerted_force_vs__pressure",
  "title": "Pneumatic Cylinder - Excerted Force vs. Pressure",
  "description": "Calculate the force exerted by single acting and double acting pneumatic cylinders based on pressure and piston diameter",
  "type": "calculator-chart",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "# Pneumatic Cylinder Force Calculator\n\n## Single Acting Cylinder\n\nThe force exerted by a single acting pneumatic cylinder is calculated as:\n\n**F = p π d² / 4**\n\nWhere:\n- F = Force exerted (N)\n- p = Gauge pressure (Pa)\n- d = Full bore piston diameter (m)\n\n## Double Acting Cylinder (Outstroke)\n\n**F = p π d₁² / 4**\n\n## Double Acting Cylinder (Instroke)\n\n**F = p π (d₁² - d₂²) / 4**\n\nWhere:\n- d₁ = Full bore piston diameter (m)\n- d₂ = Piston rod diameter (m)"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "cylinder_type",
          "label": "Cylinder Type",
          "type": "select",
          "options": [
            {
              "label": "Single Acting",
              "value": "single"
            },
            {
              "label": "Double Acting - Outstroke",
              "value": "double_out"
            },
            {
              "label": "Double Acting - Instroke",
              "value": "double_in"
            }
          ],
          "defaultValue": "single"
        },
        {
          "id": "pressure",
          "label": "Gauge Pressure",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 100000,
          "unit": "Pa"
        },
        {
          "id": "diameter_1",
          "label": "Piston Diameter (d₁)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 0.1,
          "unit": "m"
        },
        {
          "id": "diameter_2",
          "label": "Rod Diameter (d₂)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 0.01,
          "unit": "m"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "force",
          "label": "Exerted Force",
          "formula": "inputs.pressure * 3.14159 * inputs.diameter_1 * inputs.diameter_1 / 4",
          "unit": "N",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "force_kn",
          "label": "Exerted Force",
          "formula": "inputs.pressure * 3.14159 * inputs.diameter_1 * inputs.diameter_1 / 4 / 1000",
          "unit": "kN",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
